      "id": 44,
      "scene": "apple-change",
      "text": "10月31日",
      "from": 6614,
      "to": 6668,
      "sourceStart": 96.35,
      "sourceEnd": 97.25
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "scene": "apple-change",
      "text": "苹果宣布国行版Apple智能要来了",
      "from": 6680,
      "to": 6848,
      "sourceStart": 97.45,
      "sourceEnd": 100.25
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "scene": "apple-change",
      "text": "部分体验接入了千问",
      "from": 6871,
      "to": 6964,
      "sourceStart": 100.63,
      "sourceEnd": 102.19
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "scene": "apple-change",
      "text": "你可以直接在Siri写作工具和视觉智能里用它",
      "from": 7013,
      "to": 7318,
      "sourceStart": 103.01,
      "sourceEnd": 108.09
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "scene": "apple-change",
      "text": "登录自己的千问账号或者通过 Apple 登录",
      "from": 7329,
      "to": 7465,
      "sourceStart": 108.27,
      "sourceEnd": 110.53
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "scene": "apple-change",
      "text": "阿里说，用户的请求和回复不会被拿去训练模型",
      "from": 7528,
      "to": 7831,
      "sourceStart": 111.59,
      "sourceEnd": 116.63
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
