      "from": 8896,
      "to": 9000,
      "sourceStart": 134.38,
      "sourceEnd": 136.12
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "scene": "mol1-what",
      "text": "10月31日",
      "from": 9037,
      "to": 9091,
      "sourceStart": 136.74,
      "sourceEnd": 137.64
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "scene": "mol1-what",
      "text": "国内的开源这个模型，权重和代码都放出来了",
      "from": 9102,
      "to": 9356,
      "sourceStart": 137.82,
      "sourceEnd": 142.06
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "它做的是生物分子结构预测",
      "from": 9378,
      "to": 9499,
      "sourceStart": 142.42,
      "sourceEnd": 144.44
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "抗体，蛋白",
      "from": 9506,
      "to": 9552,
      "sourceStart": 144.56,
      "sourceEnd": 145.32
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "小分子，这几类都能算",
      "from": 9557,
      "to": 9643,
      "sourceStart": 145.4,
      "sourceEnd": 146.84
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "官方给出的数字是",
      "from": 9643,
      "to": 9727,
      "sourceStart": 146.84,
      "sourceEnd": 148.24
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "抗体抗原测试集成功率75%",
      "from": 9736,
      "to": 9923,
      "sourceStart": 148.38,
      "sourceEnd": 151.5
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "和这个平台上公布的75.6%差不多",
      "from": 9923,
      "to": 10211,
      "sourceStart": 151.5,
      "sourceEnd": 156.3
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "他们还自己做了个实验",
      "from": 10228,
      "to": 10307,
      "sourceStart": 156.58,
      "sourceEnd": 157.9
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "17 个靶点都拿到了候选",
      "from": 10318,
      "to": 10430,
      "sourceStart": 158.08,
      "sourceEnd": 159.96
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "这些数都是公司自己报的",
      "from": 10439,
      "to": 10678,
      "sourceStart": 160.1,
      "sourceEnd": 164.08
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "scene": "mol1-numbers",
      "text": "第三方还没有复核",
      "from": 10682,
      "to": 10739,
      "sourceStart": 164.16,
      "sourceEnd": 165.1
    },
